# Card preview

Tapping a `DexCard` opens a modal preview. Do not navigate away from the dex grid. Backdrop dismiss, swipe down, or close control.

The preview shows the specimen photo (medium size, not the grid thumb) and **stacks VFX for every visual tag on that specimen**, not only the current dex track.

| Tag | Preview effect |
|---|---|
| Shadow | Purple aura around the card |
| Shiny | Sparkles / shine sweep |
| Purified | Soft white-blue glow |
| Hundo | Brief star/gold pulse |
| Costume / background | Photo already shows it; small chip, no extra VFX |

Example: Shadow Dex cover that is shiny+shadow+Tokyo → purple aura **and** sparkles, Tokyo photo, chips for all tags.

Keep VFX on preview only (one card). CSS/Canvas, pause when closed, respect `prefers-reduced-motion` (static glow). Preview actions: `Set as cover`, open species gallery. No pin.
